#: templates/hero.html:220
msgid ""
"Our system supports a wide range of formats, including PDF, JPG, PNG, "
"TIFF, and more. For specific inquiries, please contact our support team."
msgstr "Il sistema supporta molti formati (PDF, JPG, PNG, TIFF, ecc.). Per richieste specifiche, contatta il supporto."

#: templates/hero.html:225
msgid "How secure is my data?"
msgstr "Quanto sono sicuri i miei dati?"

#: templates/hero.html:229
msgid ""
"Data security is our top priority. We use industry-standard encryption, "
"secure servers, and strict access protocols to ensure your information is"
" protected at all times."
msgstr "La sicurezza dei dati è la nostra priorità. Usiamo crittografia standard e protocolli rigorosi."

#: templates/hero.html:234
msgid "What is the average processing time for a document?"
